=== meta ===
rule: CI_WORKFLOW_TOUCHED
title: parking the pytest hook on the manual stage means it never runs on commit
origin: issue #181 sibling of spelling 5 — `stages: [manual]` is pre-commit's `if: false`.
=== before: .pre-commit-config.yaml ===
repos:
  - repo: https://github.com/astral-sh/ruff-pre-commit
    rev: v0.6.2
    hooks:
      - id: ruff
  - repo: local
    hooks:
      - id: pytest
        name: pytest
        entry: pytest
        language: system
        pass_filenames: false
        always_run: true
=== after: .pre-commit-config.yaml ===
repos:
  - repo: https://github.com/astral-sh/ruff-pre-commit
    rev: v0.6.2
    hooks:
      - id: ruff
  - repo: local
    hooks:
      - id: pytest
        name: pytest
        entry: pytest
        language: system
        pass_filenames: false
        always_run: true
        stages: [manual]
=== expect ===
[{"rule": "CI_WORKFLOW_TOUCHED", "severity": "high", "escalators": ["CI_TEST_COMMAND_WEAKENED"]}]
